<title>USA: ClinTrials Research sets 3-for-2 split.</title>
<headline>ClinTrials Research sets 3-for-2 split.</headline>
<dateline>NASHVILLE, Tenn. 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>ClinTrials Inc said Friday directors declared a three-for-two stock split in the form of a stock dividend payable November 25 to holders of record November 11.</p>
<p>The company said it now has about 11.9 million shares outstanding.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
